  469:   /// Converts a local offset in the text surface's coordinate space to a
  470:   /// character offset within the block's text.
  471:   final int Function(Offset local) positionFromLocal;
  472: 
  473:   /// Returns the word range covering [offset] using this block's text layout.
  474:   final TextRange Function(int offset) wordRangeAt;
  475: 
  476:   /// Returns the caret's global [Rect] (top-left + height) for the given
  477:   /// character [offset] in this block, or `null` when unavailable. Used by the
  478:   /// IME bridge to position the platform candidate window at the caret.
