  496:   /// Translates an offset in the hit-test frame's local space into the text
  497:   /// surface's local space. Defaults to identity when [hitTestKey] == [key]
  498:   /// (plain paragraph/code surfaces). For table cells it strips the cell
  499:   /// padding and re-centres the point onto the laid-out text region.
  500:   final Offset Function(Offset)? _hitLocalToTextLocal;
